    "All 16 original NGCUC cases covered exactly once in one full native-resolution owner export under fixed 2.4 MB. Preserve 14 interior selections and both original gate-edge selections; no weaker replacement. Four quarterly 2022 00Z model probes are not seasonal means, annual extrema or historical occupations. Zero ocean retrieval.",
    "Reuse the entire unchanged validated native_velocity_depth_curtain_v2.curtain function directly with original mixed-interval validator/diagnose and exact graph/runs/frozen connected_layer. Require the exact original mixed source schema, longitude tag/axis, own original operator/section definitions/owner/date matrix and unique batch. No adapter/tag insertion/source edits/interpolation. All original candidates, selected core/primary layer and seed-run boundaries reproduce.",
    "Preserve fixed 290-degree northwest component, complete finite positive 100-300 m interval integral/core window, 0.1 m/s primary and null surface/relative/thermal gates. Source 5/10/20 cm/s sensitivities retain original own seeds at the same selected column. Selection endpoints do not impose bottoms. A seasonally reversing surface current does not discard the declared subsurface diagnostic.",
    "Four 142/143.5/145/146E cuts and original latitude gates cover partial northern PNG downstream of Vitiaz, not passages, upstream Solomon flow, surface NGCC or equatorial retroflection/EUC. Fixed component is not a reconstructed local alongshore frame. Historical Ueki core/ENSO variability and separate 140E GLORYS mean core/reach do not impose 2022 HYCOM bounds or named-body identity.",
    "Preserve four-native-axis-neighbor connectivity without diagonal/missing bridges, core replacement or cutoff tuning. Separate runs, crossings and missing/domain/lateral censors remain. Model support spans are not physical thickness; brackets are not uncertainty; missing is not zero/seabed/current absence. No physical body/axis/water mass/bottom, whole-route profile, annual range, width/area/volume, new refs or identity inheritance.",
    "Preserve all 808 heterogeneous depth references, prior regional/fitted products, 102 eddy size references and main/runtime/UI. Case/profile-date counts are not independent observations.",
    "Cloud-only sequential one idle CPU: six original source checks plus 15 new checks and actual build. Tests block Dataset/urlopen, verify complete bounded matrix, entire validated function/shared selector identity, original northwest frame/intervals/null gates/quarter dates/core/boundaries, source immutability and geometry/time/frame/diagnosis/schema/tag/gate mutation rejection, and gate-edge outcomes without replacement. Local static editing/AST, metadata/hashes and exact retention only."
  ],
